{"number":100,"nameArabic":"العاديات","nameTransliterated":"Al-'Adiyat","nameTranslated":"The Courser","revelationPlace":"makkah","versesCount":11,"verses":[{"ayah":1,"verseKey":"100:1","textAr":"وَٱلۡعَٰدِيَٰتِ ضَبۡحٗا","transliteration":"WaalAAadiyati dabhan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"By the racers, panting"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"قسم ہے اُن (گھوڑوں) کی جو پھنکارے مارتے ہوئے دوڑتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":2,"verseKey":"100:2","textAr":"فَٱلۡمُورِيَٰتِ قَدۡحٗا","transliteration":"Faalmooriyati qadhan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the producers of sparks [when] striking"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر (اپنی ٹاپوں سے) چنگاریاں جھاڑتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":3,"verseKey":"100:3","textAr":"فَٱلۡمُغِيرَٰتِ صُبۡحٗا","transliteration":"Faalmugheerati subhan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And the chargers at dawn"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر صبح سویرے چھاپہ مارتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":4,"verseKey":"100:4","textAr":"فَأَثَرۡنَ بِهِۦ نَقۡعٗا","transliteration":"Faatharna bihi naqAAan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Stirring up thereby [clouds of] dust"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اس موقع پر گرد و غبار اڑاتے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":5,"verseKey":"100:5","textAr":"فَوَسَطۡنَ بِهِۦ جَمۡعًا","transliteration":"Fawasatna bihi jamAAan","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Arriving thereby in the center collectively"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"پھر اِسی حالت میں کسی مجمع کے اندر جا گھستے ہیں"}]},{"ayah":6,"verseKey":"100:6","textAr":"إِنَّ ٱلۡإِنسَٰنَ لِرَبِّهِۦ لَكَنُودٞ","transliteration":"Inna alinsana lirabbihi lakanoodun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed mankind, to his Lord, is ungrateful"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"حقیقت یہ ہے کہ انسان اپنے رب کا بڑا ناشکرا ہے"}]},{"ayah":7,"verseKey":"100:7","textAr":"وَإِنَّهُۥ عَلَىٰ ذَٰلِكَ لَشَهِيدٞ","transliteration":"Wainnahu AAala thalika lashaheedun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And indeed, he is to that a witness"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور وہ خود اِس پر گواہ ہے"}]},{"ayah":8,"verseKey":"100:8","textAr":"وَإِنَّهُۥ لِحُبِّ ٱلۡخَيۡرِ لَشَدِيدٌ","transliteration":"Wainnahu lihubbi alkhayri lashadeedun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And indeed he is, in love of wealth, intense"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور وہ مال و دولت کی محبت میں بری طرح مبتلا ہے"}]},{"ayah":9,"verseKey":"100:9","textAr":"۞أَفَلَا يَعۡلَمُ إِذَا بُعۡثِرَ مَا فِي ٱلۡقُبُورِ","transliteration":"Afala yaAAlamu itha buAAthira ma fee alquboori","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"But does he not know that when the contents of the graves are scattered"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"تو کیا وہ اُس حقیقت کو نہیں جانتا جب قبروں میں جو کچھ (مدفون) ہے اُسے نکال لیا جائے گا"}]},{"ayah":10,"verseKey":"100:10","textAr":"وَحُصِّلَ مَا فِي ٱلصُّدُورِ","transliteration":"Wahussila ma fee alssudoori","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"And that within the breasts is obtained"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"اور سینوں میں جو کچھ (مخفی) ہے اُسے برآمد کر کے اس کی جانچ پڑتال کی جائے گی؟"}]},{"ayah":11,"verseKey":"100:11","textAr":"إِنَّ رَبَّهُم بِهِمۡ يَوۡمَئِذٖ لَّخَبِيرُۢ","transliteration":"Inna rabbahum bihim yawmaithin lakhabeerun","translations":[{"lang":"en","translator":"Saheeh International (via quranenc.com)","text":"Indeed, their Lord with them, that Day, is [fully] Acquainted"},{"lang":"ur","translator":"Fateh Muhammad Jalandhari (via quranenc.com)","text":"یقیناً اُن کا رب اُس روز اُن سے خوب باخبر ہوگا"}]}]}